===============================================================================
4. CARRY-04 - still no recurrence
===============================================================================

No MSB3030. CARRY-04 (an intermittent copy-local race on a referenced
WinExe's runtimeconfig.json) was observed ONCE at the Phase 3 gate and has
not reappeared in any clean-clone run since, including P4-14's two and this
one. It stays a watch item, not a closed one - the count of runs without a
recurrence is not evidence the fragility is gone, and tasks.md's own wording
is that a second sighting is what would turn it into a card.
